.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt STDALIGN 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm stdalign
.Nd alignment macros
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In stdalign.h
.Fn alignas "type"
.Fn alignof "type"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.In stdalign.h
header provides two macros that name the ISO C alignment specifier and
operator.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fn alignas
Expands to
.Va _Alignas .
It specifies the alignment of an object or a member.
.It Fn alignof
Expands to
.Va _Alignof .
It yields the alignment requirement of a type as a value of type
.Vt size_t .
.El
.Pp
The macros
.Dv __alignas_is_defined
and
.Dv __alignof_is_defined
are defined to
.Dv 1
and can be used to detect that the header is available.
.Pp
In ISO C23
.Va alignas
and
.Va alignof
are keywords and the header no longer defines the macros; including it is
harmless and has no effect.
.Sh STANDARDS
The
.In stdalign.h
header conforms to
.St -isoC-2011
and ISO/IEC 9899:2024 (C23).
.Sh HISTORY
The
.In stdalign.h
header appeared in
.Ox 8.0 .
